{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/17524-ideas-for-god-machine-workings-in-pre-industrial-times","id":17524,"title":"Ideas for God-Machine workings in Pre-Industrial Times","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-24T22:50:36-08:00","id":17524,"title":"Ideas for God-Machine workings in Pre-Industrial Times","content":"There's been a lot of interest in how to see &quot;techgnostic espionage&quot; in the times when the &quot;tech-&quot; part isn't nearly so advanced. What would you do?<br /> <br /> I like the idea of the God-Machine hijacking the famed aqueducts of Rome for Infrastructure, perhaps as currents for Essence. They resemble veins or circuits in a way, keeping the grand machine of Rome running. It could just as easily have Infrastructure in the complex mechanisms beneath the Flavian Amphitheater, perhaps feeding on blood or the souls of slain gladiators.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T04:48:22-08:00","id":17654,"title":"","content":"You'd probably see a lot of overlap with Mummy and its sacred geometry, aye, or possibly Infrastructure only looks like machinery because that's how the human brain processes it and it would, in pre-industrial times, perhaps look more overtly magical. Or you could go for a more thinking engine approach - looms can be used to record information and are programmable. Babbage's difference and analytic engines, though a bit late for this, could appear far earlier. You could also go more for a an abacus, slide-rules, astrolabes and have 'manned' Infrastructure with teams of mathematician-angels slaving away.<br /> <br /> But this is assuming that the God-Machine was around back then. Personally I like the idea that it triggered the industrial and digital ages as they better suit its plans to control the world - globalisation, instantaneous communication, computerised records... All suit it. If this is the case, however, perhaps it was deliberately holding back older societies, several of which <i>could </i>have had an industrial revolution of sorts if someone had realised what do to/been listened to. Maybe back then it was working on a different way to achieve the same ends, or wasn't even a machine... Conspiracy theories are fun. There's also the fragments of more advanced technologies, or what could be used to create them. like Baghdad batteries, the Antikythera mechanism. History may have labelled most as fakes and frauds, but, well, the God-Machine is the one rewriting history... Maybe these are remnants of Infrastucture or other esoterica left behind by the God-Machine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":452,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","user":"Eremite","date":". 11-26-2013, 07:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T15:21:08-08:00","id":17969,"title":"","content":"My modern godmachines incorporates highly futuristic technologies that humans have yet to come close to figuring out, as well as older, more &quot;primitive&quot; mechanisms that wouldve been cutting edge long ago, but the GM knew just HOW to design and implement them for its uses. As such, my GM looked the same in the dark ages and in ancient Irem as it does now. Though, as you pointed out, the ST has to decide when the GM began interfering with our reality--its possible the GM is relatively new and recent, and has only just begun sending angels back in time to conquer history for itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T02:47:45-08:00","id":18315,"title":"","content":"[Annoying content removed]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1281-aegontargaryen","user":"AegonTargaryen","date":". 11-26-2013, 05:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1281-aegontargaryen","name":"AegonTargaryen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1281_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T03:05:22-08:00","id":18320,"title":"","content":"Any real reason you chose to repost your anti-God-Machine rant in my thread and say pretty much nothing about my topic?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T04:11:15-08:00","id":18341,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that didn't really add anything.<br /> <br /> Incidentally the plot hook you hate is an obvious reference (and not the only one) in the GMC book to the film <i>Dark City</i>, which they're quite open about as they namecheck it at one point. It's recommended watching for and God-Machine games.<br /> <br /> Though it's overt and lacking in mythological themes, and frankly a little underdeveloped as plot hooks go, it does fit perfectly with a major theme of the nWoD - that the world is full of supernatural darkness and most people don't, even refuse to, see it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T23:17:52-08:00","id":18974,"title":"","content":"Machines are nothing new. From the wheel to a simple lever and pulley. The God-Machine has always been there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1254-grieck","name":"grieck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1254_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T04:41:51-08:00","id":19092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>grieck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/17524-ideas-for-god-machine-workings-in-pre-industrial-times?p=18974#post18974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Machines are nothing new. From the wheel to a simple lever and pulley. The God-Machine has always been there.</div> </div> </div> </div>While that is an excellent point, concealment infrastructure in particular has to generally adapt to its surroundings. Gears in older times may have been hidden away in a smithy, perhaps, or in the architecture of a cathedral. A plow goes across a field at the same time each day, making a giant arcane rune in the ground instead of straight rows.<br /> <br /> Going back before even medieval times, I would have to say the gears are likely tucked away in landscapes or forests--anything big enough or deep enough to keep things hidden.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","user":"Metamurpho","date":". 11-27-2013, 11:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T05:38:01-08:00","id":19110,"title":"","content":"if you think sbout cadtles there are quite a few with secret passageways,..... it could also be hidden there. additionally in some parts of africa(northern) the technology was QUITE advanced in medieval times. they made small puppet theatres driven by water and steam used to move geArs. thus also able to hide there","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T10:59:58-08:00","id":19268,"title":"","content":"I'd say that churches and other holy sites could be concealing infrastructure--machines in the depths of a grand, expensive church.. stone circles that gather energy and funnel it undeground via massive cables. in those ancient times, the god machine may have utilized underground and, perhaps, flying or orbital infrastructure (much as i am sure it does now), and even then, plain buildings could largely hide its machinery. Plus, occult infrastructure exists today as it did then. A library, arranged to its designs, could have the collections of words as an infrastructure that serves as a database for local angels, for example. Human beings and other lifeforms are biomechanical machines, and can become an infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T15:04:24-08:00","id":19370,"title":"","content":"I would go with an anachronistic route, built on the discovery of the Antikythera mechanism. <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antikythera_mechanism\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antikythera_mechanism<br /> S</a>imilar to what Eremite suggested. Imagine these devices were not unique, but the remains of a technological era in antiquity. What rises may fall. and perhaps The God-Machine has risen before. Risen and fallen. Like the Tower of Babel or Atlantis, the stories of advanced and powerful civilizations falling are not uncommon. And perhaps such a civilization of gears and fountains, inspired Plato as he looked on it's remains.<br /> <br /> Or perhaps the God-Machine was just a lot less powerful in ages past. Perhaps it is more fitting to play an angel, giving more autonomy then modern ones. Angels who labor on behalf of a distant and humble (or humbled) master. Trying to find places for him to grow and take root while fighting powerful enemies who dwarf the machine in their power. But weak does not make him any less alien, and angels may begin to question weather they serve a caretaker or parasite. Or whether there is any need for tools when the job is done","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1348-hecktar","name":"Hecktar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}